{"id":"603146","name":"牛排","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/603146/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛里脊","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小番茄","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉去血水，切片，用刀背敲打。","img":"images/603146/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入黑胡椒粉和盐以及生抽蚝油和葱姜水和玉米油。","img":"images/603146/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用手抓匀，放冰箱冷藏一夜。","img":"images/603146/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"西兰花切小块，焯水。","img":"images/603146/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"土豆去皮切小块，蒸熟。","img":"images/603146/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中放入橄榄油，中火，牛排两面煎熟。","img":"images/603146/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"土豆和西兰花放入油锅中，煎香，放椒盐，生抽。","img":"images/603146/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/603146/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}